note as BOUNDARY_diagram_18_clinical_ext
  Scheduling availability is not a reservation guarantee. Appointment booking
  uses database constraints/idempotency and a bounded lock workflow in clinical.
end note

note as PRIVACY_diagram_18_clinical_ext
  Family and social history are clinical data and must not flow into product
  analytics or public community content.
end note

